# Opinion

Meeting: 0029-switch-calendar-backend-to-postgres
Agent: TestEngineer
Task: switch calendar backend to postgres
Context: Persistence introduces new failure modes (connection errors, schema issues) we must test.
Position: Integration tests against Postgres are mandatory; readiness endpoints should surface storage health.
Recommendations:
- Add fixtures that spin up the local cluster and validate DB creation, state replacement, and participant/override handling.
- Cover environment-driven configuration (`DATABASE_URL`) and ensure the server still responds correctly.
- Keep pytest fast by reusing the system cluster and cleaning databases after each test.
